4. Understand the most important Java concepts
- TreeSet<Integer> keeps available slot numbers sorted.
- TreeMap<Integer, Car> keeps parked cars ordered by slot number, which makes status output sorted automatically.
- HashMap<String, Integer> looks up a car's slot using its registration number.
- computeIfAbsent() creates a colour entry if it doesn't exist yet.
- StringJoiner builds comma-separated query results.
